<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Vaal Reefs in talks on Eastvaal, Southvaal.</title>
<headline>Vaal Reefs in talks on Eastvaal, Southvaal.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vaal Reefs Exploration and Mining Company Ltd said on Thursday it was considering proposals which, if approved, would result in Eastvaal Gold Holdings Ltd and Southvaal Holdings Ltd becoming its wholly-subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Vaal Reefs currently holds 30 percent of Eastvaal's issued share capital and 25 percent of Southvaal's issued share capital.</p>
<p>It said that pending a further announcement, shareholders should exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
